{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_ETHIF_SECTION_7_7_Message_Transmission","src":"manifest","doc":"SWS_TcpIp","page":47,"text":"7.7 Message Transmission\n[SWS_TcpIp_00175] ⌈If data is transmitted using a socket which is bound to an IPv4\nUnicast local address (TcpIpAddrId) the TcpIp shall use the IP address assigned to\nthe local address (TcpIpAddrId) as source IP address in the IP datagram header.\nThe IP datagram shall be transmitted using the EthIfCtrl the local address (TcpI-\npAddrId) is mapped to.⌋()\n[SWS_TcpIp_00176] ⌈If data is transmitted using an IPv4 socket which is bound to a\nlocal address (TcpIpAddrId) using the wildcard \"ANY\", then the TcpIp shall use the IP\naddress of the configured local address (TcpIpAddrId), which is of type IPv4 Unicast\nand assigned to the same EthIfCtrl, as the bound local address (TcpIpAddrId)\nas source IP address in the IP datagram header.⌋()\n[SWS_TcpIp_00177] ⌈If data is transmitted using an IPv4 socket which is bound to\nTCPIP_LOCALADDRID_ANY, then the TcpIp shall use the IP address of the config-\nured local address (TcpIpAddrId), which is of type IPv4 Unicast and assigned to\nthe EthIfCtrl in the same subnet as the destination IPv4 address as source IP ad-\ndress in the IP datagram header. If no matching subnet is found the IPv4 Unicast local\naddress (TcpIpAddrId) of EthIfCtrl = 0 is selected.⌋()\n[SWS_TcpIp_00178] ⌈If data is transmitted using an IPv4 UDP socket which is bound\nto a local address (TcpIpAddrId) of type Multicast, then the TcpIp shall use the IP\naddress of the configured local address (TcpIpAddrId), which is of type IPv4 Unicast\nand assigned to the same EthIfCtrl, as the bound local address (TcpIpAddrId)\nas source IP address in the IP datagram header.⌋()\n[SWS_TcpIp_00179] ⌈If data is transmitted using an IPv4 UDP socket which is bound\nto a local address (TcpIpAddrId) of type Broadcast, then the TcpIp shall use the IP\naddress of the configured local address (TcpIpAddrId), which is of type IPv4 Unicast\nand assigned to the same EthIfCtrl, as the bound local address (TcpIpAddrId)\nas source IP address in the IP datagram header.⌋()\n[SWS_TcpIp_00180]…","caption":"7.7 Message Transmission","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_ETHIF_SECTION_7_7_Message_Transmission","releases":["R23-11"],"page":47,"hash":"612f72628b1f3daf","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/0c56201f2483/page_47.webp"}],"releases":["R23-11"],"screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/0c56201f2483/page_47.webp","trel":"R23-11","tstat":"section","drop":"R24-11","kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_TcpIp_00101] im Text von SWS_TcpIp.","rel":["R23-11"],"id":"SWS_TcpIp_00101"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_TcpIp_00131] im Text von SWS_TcpIp.","rel":["R23-11"],"id":"SWS_TcpIp_00131"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_TcpIp_00175] im Text von SWS_TcpIp.","rel":["R23-11"],"id":"SWS_TcpIp_00175"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_TcpIp_00176] im Text von SWS_TcpIp.","rel":["R23-11"],"id":"SWS_TcpIp_00176"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_TcpIp_00177] im Text von SWS_TcpIp.","rel":["R23-11"],"id":"SWS_TcpIp_00177"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_TcpIp_00178] im Text von SWS_TcpIp.","rel":["R23-11"],"id":"SWS_TcpIp_00178"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_TcpIp_00179] im Text von SWS_TcpIp.","rel":["R23-11"],"id":"SWS_TcpIp_00179"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_TcpIp_00180] im Text von SWS_TcpIp.","rel":["R23-11"],"id":"SWS_TcpIp_00180"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":